Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:58.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(676,240)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.25,0:01:03.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:03.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.75,0:01:12.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:12.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Out
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.62,0:01:14.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚出去  你们这些肮脏的小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.62,0:01:14.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Out, you filthy little things
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.30,0:01:22.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我裤子都被弄破了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.30,0:01:22.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me britches have been breached
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你那打保龄球的姿势不错嘛  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice bowling form, Mr. K
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把面包上被咬过的地方切掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cut the nibbled edges off of these buns
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.25,0:01:36.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续正常拿来用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:36.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and get them in rotation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.82,0:01:43.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的洞有点麻麻的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:43.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My holes are tingling
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.17,0:01:45.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有人在盯着我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:45.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Someone's watching me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.63,0:01:53.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:53.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's you guys
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.32,0:01:56.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁蟹老板没发现  把你们处理好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:56.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I better take care of you before Mr. Krabs sees you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:56.97,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1294,920)}照 顾
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.53,0:02:08.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,慢用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:08.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:09.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:09.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mangia
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.60,0:02:10.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:10.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So cute
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.02,0:02:14.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我们还等什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:14.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.97,0:02:16.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:16.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's eat
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.99,0:02:20.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,忙碌了一天后
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.25,0:02:25.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天好漫长啊  对吧蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:25.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was quite a long day, eh, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.33,0:02:26.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过现在也忙完了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:26.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it's over now
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.70,0:02:28.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还没完  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:28.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not for you, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.25,0:02:30.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚收到海神王的特别订单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:30.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Special order from King Neptune just came in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:34.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,536)}海神王陛下\N特此下订\N{\fnArial}10000{\fnAdobe 黑体 Std R}份蟹黄堡\N早上八点前做好
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.72,0:02:33.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一万份蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:33.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Ten thousand Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.09,0:02:34.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早上八点前做好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:34.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by 8:00 am"
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.99,0:02:36.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.99,0:02:36.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.72,0:02:38.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,挺棒的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:38.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Isn't it wonderful?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.59,0:02:42.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你干得开心  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:42.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have fun, kid-o
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.52,0:02:57.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,打个瞌睡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:57.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a little nap
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.47,0:02:58.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后再
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.47,0:02:58.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then I'll
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做完剩下的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,finish the rest of the
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.05,0:03:02.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,单子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:02.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,order
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.68,0:03:30.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,善有善报
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:30.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One good turn deserves another
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.56,0:03:32.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来下厨吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:32.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get cooking
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.19,0:03:34.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:34.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.94,0:03:36.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:36.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.05,0:04:08.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,驾  银餐具
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:08.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi-ho, silverware
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.78,0:04:49.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都早上了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:49.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's morning
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.68,0:04:51.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡没做完
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:51.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I didn't finish the patties
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.69,0:04:55.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:55.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.27,0:04:58.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不记得做了这些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:58.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't remember doing all this
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.91,0:05:01.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:01.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good work, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.50,0:05:04.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,送完海神王的单子还绰绰有余
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:02.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's enough here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:04.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for King Neptune's order and then some
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来就章鱼哥负责了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward can take over now
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.19,0:05:07.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天你放假吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.19,0:05:07.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take the day off
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.83,0:05:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然不带薪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Without pay of course
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.27,0:05:18.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.27,0:05:18.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.57,0:05:20.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我该上班的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:20.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I should be working
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.59,0:05:23.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,十三小时后
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.36,0:05:25.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天好无聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.36,0:05:25.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a boring day
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.00,0:05:27.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做的事就只有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:27.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All I did was
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.01,0:05:28.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做家务
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:28.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,do some chores
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.51,0:05:29.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去公园遛小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:29.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,take Gary to the park
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.93,0:05:31.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跑跑腿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:31.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,run some errands
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,go jellyfishing
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.10,0:05:33.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟派大星到手套乐园玩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:33.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Glove World with Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赢得歌咏比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,win a singing competition
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟珊迪跳伞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,skydiving with Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,获赠城市钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,receive the key to the city
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.19,0:05:40.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还清学贷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:40.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and pay off my student loans
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.49,0:05:44.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起码明天就能回去上班做蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.49,0:05:43.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,At least tomorrow I'll be back at work
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:44.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.72,0:05:45.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:45.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.81,0:05:50.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:50.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going to work
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.55,0:05:54.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:54.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.58,0:05:56.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:56.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.95,0:06:05.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道你怎么做到的  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:05.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you do it, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过你今天也可以休假
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you can take today off too
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.37,0:06:11.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.37,0:06:11.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just don't get it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.46,0:06:13.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我又边梦游边做蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:13.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe I've been sleep cooking again?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.83,0:06:14.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:14.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看监控录像带
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll check the security tapes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:25.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\pos(582,318)}17{\fnAdobe 黑体 Std R}号摄像机
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.12,0:06:28.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:28.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.57,0:06:33.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.57,0:06:33.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.04,0:06:35.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,目前啥都没
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:35.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing so far
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.54,0:06:36.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:36.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.13,0:06:39.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:39.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.97,0:06:41.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一定在做梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.97,0:06:41.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I must be dreaming
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.61,0:06:45.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你没做梦  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:45.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not dreaming, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.67,0:06:48.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我今晚最好回来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:48.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then I better come back tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,亲眼看看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And see for yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.73,0:07:07.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:07.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.99,0:07:09.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.99,0:07:09.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.82,0:07:11.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:11.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.09,0:07:13.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:13.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.97,0:07:16.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:16.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.08,0:07:18.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:18.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就跟录像上的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just like on the tape
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How cute is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.94,0:07:22.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:22.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.86,0:07:24.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.86,0:07:24.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making Krabby Patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.51,0:07:25.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.51,0:07:25.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's my job
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.90,0:07:34.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们是啥玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:34.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.87,0:07:37.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么在做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:37.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why are you making Krabby Patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.22,0:07:39.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看我们长什么样  大聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:39.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do we look like, brainiac?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.18,0:07:40.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:40.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're elves
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过你第一次见到我们的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:43.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But the first time you saw us
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们长这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we looked like this
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.05,0:07:50.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你给我们东西吃  传递了善心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:50.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You did us a kindness by feeding us
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.47,0:07:53.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们就帮你工作  回报善心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:51.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're returning that kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:53.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,by doing your work for you
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那  多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks, I guess
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.20,0:07:59.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你们可以停了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:59.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you can stop now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.16,0:08:00.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能停
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:00.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can't stop
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.68,0:08:01.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是我们的信条
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:01.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's our creed
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.02,0:08:05.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,善有善报
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:05.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One good turn deserves another
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.35,0:08:07.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我们要一直帮你做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.35,0:08:07.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So we'll keep making Krabby Patties for you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.88,0:08:09.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:09.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,forever
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.65,0:08:10.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一辈子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:10.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forever?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.05,0:08:13.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道要怎么赶走你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:13.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know how to get rid of you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.97,0:08:15.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朗普斯金快快走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:15.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rumpelstiltskin
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.27,0:08:21.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朗普斯金是小矮人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:21.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rumpelstiltskin was an imp
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们是精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're elves
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.11,0:08:26.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喊名字这种把戏整不到我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:26.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That name mumbo jumbo don't work on us
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,识相的话就不准进来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And stay out, if you know what's good for you
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.64,0:08:35.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那家伙太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:35.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you believe that guy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.05,0:08:36.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,居然想打断我们做好事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.05,0:08:36.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,trying to interrupt our good deed?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.71,0:08:51.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听好了  你们这些童话故事的弃儿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:51.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you fairy-tale rejects
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.29,0:08:53.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说真的  只要你们行行好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:53.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really, if you'd all just be kind enough
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.91,0:08:55.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正常离开不闹事  我会很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:55.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to leave without any drama, I'd really appreciate--
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.61,0:08:59.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:08:59.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.41,0:09:01.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,精灵末日时间到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:01.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's elf-pocalypse time
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.63,0:09:09.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:09.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotcha
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.72,0:09:23.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不想打破你们的兴致
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:23.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate to burst your bubble
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:23.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1222,920)}泡 泡
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.36,0:09:25.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实不对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:25.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I don't
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.22,0:09:26.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我超想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.22,0:09:26.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love it
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们被开除了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself sacked
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1022,920)}装 袋
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.61,0:09:44.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能别做蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:44.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Will you stop making Krabby Patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.12,0:09:45.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:45.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.05,0:09:48.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:48.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.44,0:09:51.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没配料就一个蟹黄堡都做不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:51.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Without the fixin's, they can't make any
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.49,0:09:58.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进冰库里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:58.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Into the freezer you go
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.61,0:09:59.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:09:59.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.39,0:10:00.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:00.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think of that?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.76,0:10:17.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:17.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.82,0:10:30.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闹什么闹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:30.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the rumperus?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.27,0:10:33.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就喜欢这么闹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:33.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like this rumperus
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.42,0:10:39.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:39.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听好了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.71,0:10:45.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道你在干什么傻事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:45.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of silly stuff you're into
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.92,0:10:48.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要你继续狂做蟹黄堡我就不追究
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:48.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just as long as you keep banging out Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.41,0:10:51.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可这些蟹黄堡都不是我做的  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:49.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I haven't been making
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all these Krabby Patties, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是魔法精灵做的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was the magical elves
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.46,0:10:54.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.46,0:10:54.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.68,0:10:56.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还最后一只独角兽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:56.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I'm the last of the unicorns
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.84,0:11:00.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:00.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.37,0:11:01.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都说了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:01.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.76,0:11:04.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  这些是精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:04.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, meet the elves
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.16,0:11:07.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肮脏的小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:07.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Filthy little things
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:14.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(626,742)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.48,0:11:17.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,凯伦  我倒完这些过期海霸糊就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:17.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Karen, I'll be right back after I dump this expired chum
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.37,0:11:22.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可怜又肮脏的小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.37,0:11:22.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Poor filthy little things
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.33,0:11:23.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,饿了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:23.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hungry?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.91,0:11:25.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:25.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mangia
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.35,0:11:35.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,善有善报
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:35.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One good turn deserves another
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.02,0:11:39.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做海霸糊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:39.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making us some chum, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.78,0:11:40.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:40.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you--
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.49,0:11:41.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们是在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:41.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.15,0:11:43.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别做海霸糊了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:43.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop making chum
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.90,0:11:45.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来做海霸糊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:45.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Making us some chum, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.97,0:11:50.56,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fsp40\c&H00FFC1&}哑剧时间到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:51.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(752,430)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:51.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(770,722)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:56.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1530,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(636,484)}指导总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:53.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(800,700)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:54.86,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(760,550)}制片
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:56.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(596,560)}监制
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.03,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(640,598)}监制
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.03,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1468.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,唯一比上班还要棒的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The only thing better than going to work
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.16,0:12:06.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是抄捷径早早到蟹堡王上班
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.16,0:12:06.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is taking a shortcut so I can get there even earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:07.66,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,376)}裤头村公园
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.21,0:12:13.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有哑剧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:13.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A mime
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.29,0:12:17.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:17.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.84,0:12:18.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好笨的哑剧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:18.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stupid mime
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.47,0:12:24.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:24.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Egads
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.51,0:12:26.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:26.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My, my
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.80,0:12:29.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得去一趟美黑沙龙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:29.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need to go to the tanning salon
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.52,0:12:32.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:32.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where'd I go?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.11,0:12:46.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可算是滚了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.11,0:12:46.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good riddance
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hooray
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.33,0:12:51.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:51.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Encore
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.13,0:13:00.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:00.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's me
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.09,0:13:04.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就好像在照镜子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:04.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's like looking in a mirror
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.80,0:13:07.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来  试试这个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:07.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, try this
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.61,0:13:21.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:21.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not bad
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.19,0:13:23.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赏你一毛钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:23.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's a dime
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you later
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还在演我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're still miming me, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.33,0:13:36.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王里的所有人都会看得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:36.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone at the Krusty Krab will get a kick out of this
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.37,0:13:38.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吧  这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.37,0:13:38.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, walk this way
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:44.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(376,346)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.05,0:13:47.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:47.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hiya, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.47,0:13:48.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:48.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check it out
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.51,0:13:50.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我碰到了个哑剧演员
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:50.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I found a mime
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.39,0:13:51.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:51.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.85,0:13:54.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望这只动物有打过疫苗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.85,0:13:54.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hope it's had its shots
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.31,0:13:58.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我休息去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:58.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going on my break
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.56,0:14:02.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:02.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hiya, "Squidward"
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.82,0:14:05.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有事就来厨房找我  我去做蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:05.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the kitchen cooking patties if you need me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看啊  有个演哑剧的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, a mime
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.95,0:14:13.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以来份中份蟹堡套餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:13.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I get a medium Krabby combo?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.29,0:14:23.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没得吃  是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:23.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting my food, am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道我干嘛要来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I come here
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.64,0:14:32.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来看看  她点的是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:32.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see, she ordered a
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.43,0:14:35.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哑剧演员
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.43,0:14:35.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, mime?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.97,0:14:37.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看不懂你写的哑剧字
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.97,0:14:37.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't read your mime writing
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.64,0:14:39.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:39.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.90,0:14:42.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最没用的员工
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:42.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me most useless employee
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.86,0:14:46.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被更没用的员工替代了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:46.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,has been replaced by an even uselesser employee
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他才不没用呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's not useless
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可是哑剧演员
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a mime
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.08,0:14:56.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.08,0:14:56.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can see that
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他到底是打哪里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:59.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where in Neptune's name did he come from?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.21,0:15:01.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给他一毛钱  他就从公园跟过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:01.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He followed me from the park after I gave him a dime
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.75,0:15:04.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:04.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.38,0:15:07.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能给哑剧演员打赏一毛钱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:07.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you never give a mime a dime
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:07.34,注释,,0,0,0,,[ dime（十分钱）与 mime（哑剧）谐音 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你有那运气能除掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good luck getting rid of him
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.76,0:15:11.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我干嘛要除掉他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:11.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to get rid of him?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.47,0:15:12.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:12.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's great
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.60,0:15:17.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:17.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll see
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.68,0:15:20.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过你除掉他之前  我要先除掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:20.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But until then, I'm gettin' rid of you
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.60,0:15:23.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等除掉那个哑巴小丑才可以回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:23.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't come back until you lose the quiet clown
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.57,0:15:25.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:25.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.57,0:15:26.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走了  哑剧演员
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:26.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, mime
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.78,0:15:31.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里穿堂风好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:31.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure is drafty in here
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.78,0:15:37.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然刚刚玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:37.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, that was fun
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.41,0:15:39.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你也听到蟹老板的话了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.41,0:15:39.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you heard Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.00,0:15:40.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可以走开了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:40.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can go now
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.33,0:15:43.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差不多行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:43.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's enough
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  走开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, go away now
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.71,0:15:49.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,演员不乖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:49.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad mime
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回公园去  你就属于那里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go back to the park where you belong
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.72,0:15:52.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:52.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good day
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.48,0:16:03.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吃午饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:03.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come get lunchies
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.62,0:16:22.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么快就吃完了  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.62,0:16:22.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finished already, Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.21,0:16:27.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你今天这么黏人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:27.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, you sure are affectionate today, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.50,0:16:28.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:28.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Leapin' lampreys
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.84,0:16:30.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:30.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.55,0:16:32.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,演员不乖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:32.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad mime
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.59,0:16:33.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不乖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:33.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.55,0:16:39.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是你没错吧  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:39.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is you, right, Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.11,0:16:51.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我昨天定的肯定是静音闹钟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:51.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must have set my silent alarm
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.12,0:16:59.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:16:59.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's weird
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.87,0:17:01.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我竟然能透过裤子看东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:01.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can see through my pants
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.62,0:17:02.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:02.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.83,0:17:04.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:04.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get back here
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.08,0:17:09.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说  别回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:09.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, don't get back here
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.38,0:17:10.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:10.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.30,0:17:13.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:13.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs was right
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.97,0:17:15.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我除不掉这个哑剧演员
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.97,0:17:15.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't get rid of this mime
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.93,0:17:17.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:17.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.72,0:17:19.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:19.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.39,0:17:20.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我确实需要帮手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:20.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do need some help
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可谁能来帮我解决呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But who could help me with this?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.85,0:17:24.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:24.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.52,0:17:25.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要找他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:25.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Him?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.48,0:17:27.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来非常时期就要上非常手段
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:27.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, desperate times, and all that
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.40,0:17:28.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:28.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.36,0:17:31.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:31.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm late
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.69,0:17:32.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:32.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where'd I go?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.36,0:17:33.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:33.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That way?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.82,0:17:35.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那谢了  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:35.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, thanks, Gary
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:37.95,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,724)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.28,0:17:42.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好  要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:42.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, what do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.83,0:17:45.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的海神王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:45.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sweet merciful Neptune
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.37,0:17:46.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:46.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.46,0:17:47.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:47.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need help
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.33,0:17:52.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个哑巴白痴干嘛跟着你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:52.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that silent sap doing with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.84,0:17:55.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在公园偶遇了他  打赏他一毛钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:55.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I found him in the park and I gave him a dime
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.42,0:17:56.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:56.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.88,0:17:59.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能给哑剧演员打赏一毛钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:59.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you never give a mime a dime
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.05,0:18:00.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,永别了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:00.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice knowing you, pal
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.18,0:18:03.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  我需要你帮忙除掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:03.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, I need help getting rid of him
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.81,0:18:06.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:06.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.69,0:18:12.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能稍微少一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.69,0:18:12.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perhaps something a tad less
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.48,0:18:13.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:13.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,destructive?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.28,0:18:17.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:17.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.45,0:18:21.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:21.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, everybody also knows
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.62,0:18:24.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,除掉哑剧演员最好的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:24.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the best way to get rid of a mime
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.41,0:18:28.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是让他开口说话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:28.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is to make it talk
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.59,0:18:33.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么让他说话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:33.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How are you gonna do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna catch him
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.96,0:18:35.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:35.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.76,0:18:36.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:36.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.88,0:18:39.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,折磨他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:39.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,torture him
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.13,0:18:40.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:40.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.73,0:18:50.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:50.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.73,0:18:52.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尝尝超热激光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.73,0:18:52.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eat hot laser
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.04,0:19:10.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该我出手让他开口说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:10.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's up to me to make him talk
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过要想抓到哑剧演员
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But to catch a mime
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就得像哑剧演员一样思考
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have to think like a mime
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.46,0:20:40.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哑剧大战
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:40.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mime wars
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.30,0:20:42.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,安静却又致命
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:42.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Silent but deadly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:42.34,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 这句一般用于形容放屁 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.55,0:20:48.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他是在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.55,0:20:48.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is he
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.97,0:20:51.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做蟹黄堡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.97,0:20:51.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,cooking a Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.93,0:20:52.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要那个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.93,0:20:52.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me at it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.93,0:20:54.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要那个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.93,0:20:54.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me at it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.11,0:21:03.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:03.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.82,0:21:04.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:04.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got him
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.82,0:21:06.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么让他开口说话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:06.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, how do I make him talk?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.12,0:21:08.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:08.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.03,0:21:09.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:09.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.83,0:21:15.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.83,0:21:15.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lookie here
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.59,0:21:26.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的脚趾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.59,0:21:26.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My toe
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.97,0:21:31.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你讲话了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:31.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You talked
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.06,0:21:39.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托  我我不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:39.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, I-I didn't mean it
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.73,0:21:42.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我我保证  不说话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:42.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I promise, I never talk
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.07,0:21:42.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绝对不会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.07,0:21:42.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.78,0:21:44.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没必要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:44.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.32,0:21:46.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:46.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.03,0:21:50.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些怪人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:50.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who are these freaks?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.58,0:21:53.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是管理哑剧犯罪的什么单位吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.58,0:21:53.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think they're some kind of unit for mime crime
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.16,0:21:56.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:56.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.75,0:21:57.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,贝雷帽可以给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:21:57.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can take my beret
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.87,0:22:00.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是别吊销我的哑剧执照啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.87,0:22:00.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just don't take my miming license
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.21,0:22:02.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要动它啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:02.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything but that
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.22,0:22:14.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉害你哑剧执照被吊销了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.22,0:22:14.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry we got your miming license taken away
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.98,0:22:15.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:15.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.35,0:22:17.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总之呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.35,0:22:17.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.14,0:22:21.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然你不演哑剧了  以后有什么打算
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.14,0:22:21.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are your future plans now that you're not a mime?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.28,0:22:27.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们终于让他崩溃了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.28,0:22:27.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we finally broke him
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.03,0:22:30.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我演不了哑剧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:30.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I can't be a mime
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.16,0:22:33.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我就当小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:33.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just be a clown
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.25,0:22:44.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还是更喜欢他当哑剧演员的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.25,0:22:44.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I liked him better when he was a mime
